wer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114016/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" :answer-field/choices ["q-114016/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" "q-114016/selection/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" "q-114016/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" "q-114016/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" "q-114016/selection/f509030681214332b5989836fe0af4b2eb5858d193e689fd8441dff5cd45ff45"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114016" :question/id #uuid "30144ba3-8434-5a5c-af65-968cf2badda6" :question/math-academy-id "q-114016" :question/problem "Given that ${\\int }_{3}^{1}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-6,$ calculate\n${\\int }_{1}^{3}(8-f(x))\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{3}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-{\\int }_{3}^{1}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can split up the given integral using the sum rule and factor out the constants. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{3}(8-f(x))\\,\\text{d}x & =8{\\int }_{1}^{3}\\text{d}x-{\\int }_{1}^{3}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =8\\cdot x\\,{|}_{1}^{3}-6 \\\\  & =8(3-1)-6 \\\\  & =8\\cdot 2-6 \\\\  & =10.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-114016/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ff2f1a9d-2b0e-5a18-98d5-4f49f6f1527b"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114016"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-346061/field-1/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" :answer/id #uuid "cc9ba678-6070-5c6a-bfb8-5719cbb17d1d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-346061/field-1/10293ac0295e0e79554137a949f5c5c46b9812dcc0a3ecb6349c4cb5e6acdff3" :answer/id #uuid "d7bde330-93f8-5288-895c-b37828061946" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-346061/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "4db99a97-3fbd-5b86-9827-4fa550b42518" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-346061/field-1/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" :answer-field/choices ["q-346061/field-1/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" "q-346061/field-1/10293ac0295e0e79554137a949f5c5c46b9812dcc0a3ecb6349c4cb5e6acdff3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-346061" :question/id #uuid "06db151f-c6d6-553d-91fa-0c48006d8e64" :question/math-academy-id "q-346061" :question/problem "Given that ${\\int }_{6}^{-6}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=1,$ calculate ${\\int }_{-6}^{6}(3x-9f(x))\\,\\text{d}x.$\n\n${\\int }_{-6}^{6}(3x-9f(x))\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-6}^{6}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-{\\int }_{6}^{-6}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can split up the given integral using the sum rule and factor out the constants. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-6}^{6}(3x-9f(x))\\,\\text{d}x & =3{\\int }_{-6}^{6}x\\,\\text{d}x\\,-\\,9{\\int }_{-6}^{6}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\cdot \\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}\\,{|}_{-6}^{6}\\,-\\,9(-1) \\\\  & =3\\cdot \\frac{{6}^{2}-(-6)^{2}}{2}\\,+\\,9 \\\\  & =3\\cdot 0\\,+\\,9 \\\\  & =9.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-346061/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ff2f1a9d-2b0e-5a18-98d5-4f49f6f1527b"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-346061"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-49245"] :question/problem "Given that ${\\int }_{9}^{4}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=6$, calculate\n${\\int }_{4}^{9}(4f(x)+2)\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{4}^{9}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-{\\int }_{9}^{4}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can split up the given integral using the sum rule and factor out the constants. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{4}^{9}(4f(x)+2)\\,\\text{d}x & =4{\\int }_{4}^{9}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x+2{\\int }_{4}^{9}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4(-6)+2\\cdot x\\,{|}_{4}^{9} \\\\  & =-24+2(9-4) \\\\  & =-24+10 \\\\  & =-14.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-346181/field-1/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer/id #uuid "f3a01c27-b258-5f2f-8181-05b3000f48a8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-346181/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "522d036b-4e1a-5bf6-94e7-e1a343f49cc8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-346181/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "32c7b002-864b-5b0e-b82d-79cd606e879a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-346181/field-1/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer-field/choices ["q-346181/field-1/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" "q-346181/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-346181" :question/id #uuid "443dc647-fc7d-5181-add0-610b67501f3f" :question/math-academy-id "q-346181" :question/problem "Given that ${\\int }_{6}^{-3}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{113}{9},$ calculate ${\\int }_{-3}^{6}(9f(x)+8x)\\,\\text{d}x.$\n\n${\\int }_{-3}^{6}(9f(x)+8x)\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-3}^{6}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-{\\int }_{6}^{-3}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-\\frac{113}{9}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can split up the given integral using the sum rule and factor out the constants. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-3}^{6}(9f(x)+8x)\\,\\text{d}x & =9{\\int }_{-3}^{6}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x\\,+\\,8{\\int }_{-3}^{6}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =9(-\\frac{113}{9})\\,+\\,8\\cdot \\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}\\,{|}_{-3}^{6} \\\\  & =-113\\,+\\,8\\cdot \\frac{{6}^{2}-(-3)^{2}}{2} \\\\  & =-113\\,+\\,8\\cdot \\frac{27}{2} \\\\  & =-113\\,+\\,108 \\\\  & =-5.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-346181/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ff2f1a9d-2b0e-5a18-98d5-4f49f6f1527b"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-346181"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-346059/field-1/737cf83b0a5c76b994becda299b7de3c29e8f740ee9d5a8e7d4022ee9da30c34" :answer/id #uuid "5a7fbd40-a307-5e2a-9ca7-da314561c49b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{33}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-346059/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "cf2e93b8-c705-5690-ac25-ecf35f01f174" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-346059/field-1/737cf83b0a5c76b994becda299b7de3c29e8f740ee9d5a8e7d4022ee9da30c34" :answer-field/choices ["q-346059/field-1/737cf83b0a5c76b994becda299b7de3c29e8f740ee9d5a8e7d4022ee9da30c34"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-346059" :question/id #uuid "a789764d-6c23-5081-bf29-e1cefd94e0a5" :question/math-academy-id "q-346059" :question/problem "Given that ${\\int }_{0}^{-3}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=6,$ calculate ${\\int }_{-3}^{0}(5x-f(x))\\,\\text{d}x.$\n\n${\\int }_{-3}^{0}(5x-f(x))\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-3}^{0}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-{\\int }_{0}^{-3}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can split up the given integral using the sum rule and factor out the constants. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-3}^{0}(5x-f(x))\\,\\text{d}x & =5{\\int }_{-3}^{0}x\\,\\text{d}x\\,-\\,{\\int }_{-3}^{0}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =5\\cdot \\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}\\,{|}_{-3}^{0}\\,-\\,(-6) \\\\  & =5\\cdot \\frac{0-9}{2}\\,+\\,6 \\\\  & =-\\frac{45}{2}\\,+\\,6 \\\\  & =-\\frac{33}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-346059/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ff2f1a9d-2b0e-5a18-98d5-4f49f6f1527b"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-346059"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-49249/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" :answer/id #uuid "1cf8abf3-876a-5c2f-9409-3ae2364263a5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49249/selection/21b3922c447d95ef72830e9a9ad9c4c16826fd94e990171384322edf84c2ba00" :answer/id #uuid "a4a42881-aada-5097-ae2b-d87549c783dc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "67" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49249/selection/98b3dba682900da184b39a71cd54acfbad77325cb9c895968794bd8e0854ddd0" :answer/id #uuid "6fb4a0d3-182a-53a9-b953-e917f251a481" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "58" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49249/selection/695792c47319cb1ed098a6d83038b7ad6d032838f9103d693bf346f1dc234ff8" :answer/id #uuid "b2d3b677-ee17-5c75-9ff7-751cb49a4e78" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "40" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49249/selection/f796ac21987d4f3153e3b546ba6f05903ec4f97c341f46f25a60fedd8588108b" :answer/id #uuid "3794a708-d038-5027-a85b-7218f4806df1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "37" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49249/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "fcf66a86-20a0-5a33-8c18-